Package: craft-updater
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Markus <wildcardcharacter@icloud.com>
Depends: python3, python3-tk, git, coreutils, pkg-config, cargo, build-essential, libgtk-3-dev, libasound2-dev, pkexec
Description: GUI updater and source builder for ArtCraft applications
 CraftUpdater checks ArtCraft repositories, builds selected apps from source,
 and installs them into the user's local bin directory.
